        "TileImage": "$($repository 36110202-4149-45c0-86e9-a8eb8ee25701).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome back, Grant 47.\r\rAn elite syndicate has compromised our network. Your objectives, as seen in image_bc29f2.jpg, span a high-society event. Eliminate bodyguards Sam Day and Valentina Yates cleanly with a pistol. Take out ringleader Don Archibald Yates with an explosive device. Finally, unleash the &quot;Axe Maniac&quot; persona: targets Socorro Barrios and Ambrosio Beneven must fall to a thrown Sapper&apos;s Axe.\r\rMaintain your suit. Good hunting.",
